[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0010","text":"好～！\n雏菜想去～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0020","text":"——这份工作，有什么意义？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0030","text":"那、那个……！\n我…………我想上台试试…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0040","text":"虽然不知道算不算……\n制作人说的那种理由"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0050","text":"──终于……能像以前那样和大家\n在一起了……所以…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0060","text":"就算不上舞台\n也能一直在一起的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0070","text":"那、那是……\n……是、是这样吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0080","text":"只有大家……在一点点……\n透同学……在一点点…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0090","text":"所、所以我也……想要\n追上大家……！　追上大家……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0100","text":"……浅仓怎么想"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0110","text":"……嗯，啊──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0120","text":"唔──\n呵呵，搞不懂呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0130","text":"──不过，去吧\n这可是海啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0140","text":"诶～～～！\n哇，真的耶～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0150","text":"──哇……！　是海边的花火大会呢……！\n圆、圆香同学……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0160","text":"OK——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0170","text":"不是挺好的吗\n就算没有去的理由"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0180","text":"那、那……\n能去了吗！？　大家一起……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0190","text":"可以哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0200","text":"太、太好了……！\n可以去跟制作人说吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0202","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_05_0203","text":"Motion"}]
